    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d230">

                <pb facs="0315" n="231" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg231"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Ehrman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-03"><hi rendition="#italic">November 3, 1903</hi></date>.
                        (Sent 11.18 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Message sent to <hi rendition="#italic">Nashville</hi> to Colon may not have been
                    delivered. Accordingly see that following message is sent to <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Nashville</hi> immediately: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Nashville</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Colon:</hi></p>
                        <p>In the interests of peace make every effort to prevent Government troops
                            at Colon from proceeding to Panama. The transit of the Isthmus must be
                            kept open and order maintained. Acknowledge.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Darling</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Acting.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Secure special train, if necessary. Act promptly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
